{"unit_id":"SnowNightt__dsh-token-activity#card-zh","repo":"SnowNightt/dsh-token-activity","commit":"f7736fbdd7691923d71f7d44731005843121760f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-activity 是面向 DSH Web 的 Token 用量统计插件。在 Host 侧，它把会话事件折叠为按日期和模型汇总的投影，并为已保存的历史会话提供有并发上限的回填；Web 设置中新增「使用量」页面，展示累计与峰值 Token、每日或每周热力图、模型用量和回填进度。统计范围依据 Harness 会话中记录的用量，适合想查看自身 DSH 会话用量变化的用户。组合包同时挂载 Host 与 Web 插件；可选设置统计时区和历史回填并发数。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/token-activity/src/service.ts:68-160","packages/token-activity/src/aggregate.ts:55-99","packages/ui-token-activity/src/client/index.ts:48-83","packages/ui-token-activity/src/client/TokenActivityPage.tsx:34-91"]}
